      "read_index": "10",
      "source_jp": "黄金石の有効期限は、獲得から4か月後の月末までです",
      "source_en": "GG expire at the end of the month, 4 months after\r\npurchase.",
      "text": "Goldsteine verfallen am Monatsende,\r\nvier Monate nach dem Kauf."
